    narr:narration """This hub maintains the tension between a high-level product vision and the granular outcomes of recent development. The [core differentiator thesis](narr:Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture), established in March 2026, centers the product on capturing decision artifacts at the exact moment of consensus. This vision is juxtaposed against the [Sprint 4 delivery outcomes](narr:Position_Sprint4DeliveryOutcomes) from July 2026, which detail specific technical milestones. These outcomes include the [async decision widget](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1784455139410_1) and a [record-high velocity of 23 points](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1784455139410_2). Furthermore, the team identifies the [Zephyr integration](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1784455139410_3) as the primary catalyst for these results. The hub continues to hold these elements in parallel, leaving open the question of whether the Zephyr-enabled velocity gains represent a validation of the original decision-capture thesis or a distinct operational trajectory.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1784455139410_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1784455139410_2> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1784455139410_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_Sprint4DeliveryOutcomes> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Core feature: decision capture at the point of consensus." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "We shipped the async decision widget." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1784455139410_1> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Velocity was 23 points, highest this quarter." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1784455139410_2> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "The Zephyr integration was the key unlock." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1784455139410_3> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The Zephyr integration is presented as a tactical unlock, which may be orthogonal to the core decision-capture product vision." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1784455139410_3> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture> ] ;
    narr:writer "google/gemini-3.1-flash-lite" .
